      "collections": "Nonempty API associations supply real names, equipment IDs and inventory photographs. A collection filters by association ID; it is not an invented kit or a bundle-price promise.",
      "filters": "Search and all filter rows, including equipment types and brands, are always visible before collection cards. Selected catalog chips use primary fill and primary foreground; generic filter buttons retain their softer accent treatment.",
      "selectedEquipment": "Primary border and ring; info-soft content area; photograph remains unchanged.",
      "datePanel": "Flat selected endpoints, store rental-day count, primary date text and pale information accents.",
      "calendar": "One month below 640px, two from 640px. A media listener changes the count without remounting the picker or resetting the viewed month and selected dates. Navigation and date-state labels are Russian; existing date callbacks and holiday handling remain.",
      "stickyDates": "Portalled to document.body and fixed below the 80px header; copy states availability on the selected dates.",
      "reservationFooter": "Appears with a nonzero selection, portalled to document.body and fixed at viewport bottom. Count, selected dates, reset and checkout stay available; safe-area and catalog bottom padding protect content. Entry uses 200ms with instant reduced-motion behavior.",
      "logoPress": "Fixed SVG outline; inner lens hover scale 0.975 and pressed scale 0.93; shutter pressed rotation -2.5deg. Framer Motion restores the hover or resting state on release, and resting geometry on pointer leave using 150/200ms tokens. No loop, no interception of the enclosing home link, and reduced motion disables feedback."
